| Contract | Principal trigger | Consent / notice | Key consequence | Overall risk |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Apex-Kenji JV Agreement | 50%+ voting acquisition or change in management control of a member | Notice within 10 business days after definitive agreement and within 5 business days after closing; successor joinder within 30 days | 90-day buyout option for all JV interest; formula cash price | High / Critical |
| Summit Credit Agreement | Change of control as defined in credit documents | Advance lender notice/consent or waiver required | Event of default; acceleration and enforcement | Critical |
